OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be dry, cloudy
OL,6,Fin the west with the best of any
OL,7,Fbrightness in the east. Cloud will
OL,8,Fspread east in the afternoon, when
OL,9,Fthere is the chance of an odd shower
OL,10,Fin the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe chance of a few showers
OL,13,Fin the west in the evening, otherwise
OL,14,Fdry with clear spells at times
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FThe day will continue dry with
OL,18,Fbright or sunny spells increasing into
OL,19,Fthe afternoon. Cloud will spread east
OL,20,Ftowards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
